{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "883ce036-1e87-85b0-9f3a-678c0fe726a4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T15:56:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:54:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:54:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. My name is Liam Dolan. I'm calling about a pothole on Marsh Street, in the Point. The address is 238 Marsh Street, right out front of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 238 Marsh. Is this a new one or has it been reported before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been patched. Someone from the city put cold patch in it last Wednesday, so that's, um, January the last day of December... no, sorry. Last Wednesday would be December 31st. Yes, December 31st. And it's washed out already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:54:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so the patch is gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly gone, yes. There's loose gravel scattered down the street, and the hole is back. And right now it's full of water, so you can't really see how deep it is. I almost put my front wheel in it on Monday morning, around eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, those cold patches don't hold up when it's wet and freezing and thawing. Which side of the street is it on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The odd-number side, so the same side as my house. It's about even with the front walk, maybe a foot out from the curb. Not the middle of the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:55:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me put that in. I'll note that the previous patch washed out and that it's holding water and hard to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:55:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thank you. Could I get a reference number for the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:55:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, give me a second, it's generating. [pause] Okay, it's request number 4 4 7 1 2. Do you want me to repeat that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. Four, four, seven, one, two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Four four seven one two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:56:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Sorry, I'm writing it on the back of an envelope. I used to dread making phone calls like this, honestly, but I'm getting used to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:56:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing fine. You gave me everything I needed. Do you want a callback when a crew has been out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be helpful. The number is 401-555-0153."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:56:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five three. Got it. Crews will likely get to it within the next several days, depending on what else is on the list, and the weather matters for this kind of repair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Dolan. Take care, and watch that hole until then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T15:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
